※ pl4g-test: compile=error diag=4684
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4684 LANG_CLOSABLE_OVERWRITTEN

※ Giving a variable another value while it still holds one that was not closed
※ would lose that one.

@[closed_by(close)]
type Handle = n : u8

fn Handle.close(h: Handle):
    let n: u8 = h.n

fn made(n: u8) → Handle:
    Handle(.n ← n)

@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    let h: mut Handle = made(1u8)
    h ← made(2u8)
    Handle.close(h)
    0u6
